{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spear_flint","model_identifier":"spear_flint","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## spear_flint\n\nPolearm, flint-tipped tier (own geometry).\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 128x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -1.2..1.2, z -65.0..15.0 (size 1.5 x 2.5 x 80.0 u = 4 x 7 x 225 cm).\nFlint-tipped spear, about 2.1 m (80 u): knapped flint point bound to the shaft with cord. The starting warrior's weapon (same layout as warrior_base `flint_spear`). Grip (rear hand, slot_hand_r) at the origin, 14 u from the butt, point forward (-Z). **Second grip (left hand) 11.5 u forward along the shaft** (matches warrior_base guard_polearm / attack_polearm_thrust). Edges/flats up-down (+/-Y).\n"},"description":"## spear_flint\n\nPolearm, flint-tipped tier (own geometry).\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 128x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -1.2..1.2, z -65.0..15.0 (size 1.5 x 2.5 x 80.0 u = 4 x 7 x 225 cm).\nFlint-tipped spear, about 2.1 m (80 u): knapped flint point bound to the shaft with cord. The starting warrior's weapon (same layout as warrior_base `flint_spear`). Grip (rear hand, slot_hand_r) at the origin, 14 u from the butt, point forward (-Z). **Second grip (left hand) 11.5 u forward along the shaft** (matches warrior_base guard_polearm / attack_polearm_thrust). Edges/flats up-down (+/-Y).\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"shaft","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-0.5,-58.0],"to":[0.5,0.5,14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[80,72,81.0,73.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[38,0,110.0,1.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[81,72,82.0,73.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":